  Ar_4p + O2+ -> Ar_4p + O2+;          0.0; 5.200e-19 * sqrt(8.0 * kb * T_Ar / pi * (m_Ar+m_O2) / (m_Ar*m_O2)); # Lieberman 2005, Chapt. 9, Table 9.3 
